grietjebvdm:{"n":"Grietje Berends van der Meer","d":"c. 1797–1854 · Oostermeer","b":1797,"s":"h","p":["berendw","grietjet"],"r":["nl"],"x":1854,"t":"Born at Oostermeer about 1797, the daughter of Berend Wybes (or Wiebes) and Grietje Tobias. She married Wybe Johannes Idema at Tietjerksteradeel on 28 March 1822, and died at Harkema-Opeinde on 20 August 1854, aged 57.","src":[["Marriage, 1822","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:c866d746-6702-0a02-08b8-8bb93e2c5888"],["Death record, 1854","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:cf1ced38-4f90-e997-901f-7fb1505efd9b"]]},
