klaass:{n:"Klaas Sjoerds Stok",d:"c. 1778–1849",b:1778,x:1849,s:"h",p:["sjoerdstok", "tjitskev"],r:["nl"],t:"A workman of Grouw, the son of Sjoerd Stok and Tjitske Visser. He married Theodora (Dora) Tjitske Louisa Beyermans; their son Jouke was born around 1824. He died at Grouw on 30 January 1849, aged 71.",src:[["Death record, 1849", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:3181a2c3-2316-1552-eb1a-01f340cf14ac"]]},
dora:{n:"Dora Tjitske Louisa Beyermans",d:"",s:"h",p:[],r:["nl"]},
hendrikdj:{"n":"Hendrik Durks Jonker","d":"c. 1775–1841 · Grouw","s":"h","p":["durkh","lijsberts"],"r":["nl"],"b":1775,"x":1841,"u":true,"t":"Born at Grouw. A Hendrik Durks, son of Durk Hendriks and Lijsbert Sytzes, married Lemke Jans in Idaarderadeel, the district that includes Grouw, on 14 August 1811; the ages given then and at his death do not agree, so the link to those parents is not certain. A labourer, he died on 2 May 1841 at Hoogemeeden near Aduard, over the border in Groningen, aged 66.","src":[["Marriage, Idaarderadeel, 1811","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:160e38d1-7bdc-24f9-ecf3-a2c46f6fd9e2"],["Death record, 1841","https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:ac5854ca-7c0b-3152-9d6d-647be28ea432"]]},
lemke:{"n":"Lemke Jans","d":"b. c. 1784","s":"h","p":["janjelkes","wytskew"],"r":["nl"],"b":1784,"u":true,"t":"Married Hendrik Durks in Idaarderadeel on 14 August 1811, aged 27; the bride's parents were named as Jan Jelkes and Wytske Wytzes. Their daughter Berber was born about 1825.","src":[["Marriage, Idaarderadeel, 1811","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:160e38d1-7bdc-24f9-ecf3-a2c46f6fd9e2"]]},
