epkeh:{"n":"Epke Derks Hekman","d":"c. 1786–1853 · Pekela","b":1786,"x":1853,"s":"b","p":["derkeh","jantjenegb"],"r":["nl"],"t":"Born at Pekela about 1786, the daughter of Derk Eppes Hekman, a carpenter, and Jantjen Egberts. She was in service as a maid (dienstmaagd) when she married Aaldrik Wessels Plat, then a farm servant and later a carter, at Midwolda on 7 May 1813, aged 27. Their daughter Helena was born that year, and more children followed at Finsterwolde in the 1820s. She died at Finsterwolde on 10 February 1853, aged 67.","src":[["Marriage, Midwolda, 1813","https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:1bf7e209-2371-0998-5338-a71fa4a62084"],["Death record, 1853","https://www.openarchieven.nl/gra:57e41f55-d073-3fb3-1fb9-38e79f4bda0e"]]},
